whole. The upstream LICENSE files are kept as they were, except that the
trailing lines after the end of the Apache License text in the
knowledge-work-plugins LICENSE (not part of the licence) are left out. Only
SKILL.md is installed into a team; it ends with a section that names the
source, the commit and the License.
